{"id":"newsreel-139","kind":"newsreel","corp":"HALCYON","text":"In the home of tomorrow, the door knows your face, the lights know your mood, and the kettle knows when you'll be home. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"The Home of Tomorrow"},
{"id":"newsreel-140","kind":"newsreel","corp":"HALCYON","text":"Remember keys? Remember losing them? With HALCYON Welcome™, you'll never be locked out again. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"No More Keys"},
{"id":"newsreel-141","kind":"newsreel","corp":"HALCYON","text":"Mother is home. Father is home. Little Tommy is home. And HALCYON knows it. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"Everyone's Home"},
{"id":"newsreel-142","kind":"newsreel","corp":"IRONWATCH","text":"Thanks to IRONWATCH, every street in the city has a friend on it, day and night. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"Safe Streets for Everyone"},
{"id":"newsreel-143","kind":"newsreel","corp":"IRONWATCH","text":"Mr. Hale walks to work in four minutes flat. His secret? Trusted Resident™ status, and nothing to hide. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"The Trusted Resident"},
{"id":"newsreel-144","kind":"newsreel","corp":"IRONWATCH","text":"Four officers, two drones and one very good dog are looking out for your block tonight. Sleep tight. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"Who's Watching? We Are."},
{"id":"newsreel-145","kind":"newsreel","corp":"LUCIDA","text":"Tonight, while you sleep, LUCIDA tidies up the day: a little worry here, a sharp word there. Wake up lighter. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"Rest, Reimagined"},
{"id":"newsreel-146","kind":"newsreel","corp":"LUCIDA","text":"With Dreamsave™, every good dream is kept safe, so you never lose one again. Tomorrow, together.","tag":"hint","approval":"approved","title":"Your Dreams, Saved"},
